Ctx: ksctl keys modify > Synopsis

Modifies key metadata and key rotation frequency. The metadata is patched if the existing and new metadata are in JSON format.
Otherwise, the existing metadata is replaced with the new metadata.
To modify rotation frequency of the key, set flag rotation-frequency-days to an integer value greater than or equal to 0.
All other key information will not be modified.
To modify the group permissions/custom attribute or both in metadata of all versions of the key, set flag allVersions to true in KeyJsonFile.
  JSON file example:
    {
  "meta": {
  "permissions": {
   "UseKey": [
  "group_name"
  ],
  "ReadKey": [
  "group_name"
  ],
  "DecryptWithKey": [
  "group_name"
  ],
  "EncryptWithKey": [
  "group_name"
  ]
   },
  "customAttributes": [
   {
  "name": "color",
  "type": "String",
  "value": "green"
   },
   {
  "name": "fruit",
  "type": "String",
  "value": "pma"
   }
  ]
  },
  "allVersions": true,
  "usageMask": 3,
  "description": "Information about the key"
    }

```
ksctl keys modify [flags]
```
